                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CHECK-PREMIUM-0072.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       APPLY-TERM-0073.
